{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Node Strike is a third person action game where enemies are defeated by solving puzzles. Throughout the game, players will encounter enemies that are protected by a matrix of symbols of nodes. The player must determine the order in which to destroy them while dodging attacks and then destroy all the nodes to defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will include </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 node types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a speed-running medal system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">new abilities and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">about 90-120 minutes of gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639030?t=1744311453","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639030?t=1744311453","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639030/404fed3ca3f03cee7bf14aaf5ca69160868cd078/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744311453","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639030/404fed3ca3f03cee7bf14aaf5ca69160868cd078/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744311453","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Node Strike is a third person action game where enemies are defeated by solving puzzles. Throughout the game, players will encounter enemies that are protected by a matrix of symbols of nodes. The player must determine the order in which to destroy them while dodging attacks and then destroy all the nodes to defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will include </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 levels</p><